---

This project builds and runs vanitygen, which is a separate program under a
different licence:

  vanitygen -- Copyright (C) 2011 samr7 <samr7@cs.washington.edu>
  https://github.com/samr7/vanitygen
  GNU Affero General Public License v3

vanitygen's source is NOT included here. scripts/build-vanitygen.sh clones it
from upstream at a pinned commit, applies vendor/patches/, and builds it; it is
executed as a separate process and is never linked into this software. The
patch in vendor/patches/ is a modification of vanitygen and is therefore itself
AGPL-3.0, as its header states.
